{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道争取曾给他力量，却消不掉所有牵挂，心里的安宁也是真的，却护不住现实中珍惜的东西。\",\n      \"key\": \"给他力量\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"src\": [\"S11-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想留住不必时时奋力的安宁，却发现为它争取也可能失去它。\",\n      \"key\": \"争取和安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S11-2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他发现难处不只在自己不够坚定，珍惜的东西不止一样，未必能毫发无伤地保住，便重想能承担什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"不够坚定\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S11-2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕争取会伤到珍惜的东西，心里仍疼，却知道只因害怕而不争取，也未必护得住它们，还可能让它们继续受损。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里仍疼\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S11-5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道再等不会等来容易的路，便带着不舍和痛苦继续争取，走近要承担的事时恐惧还会回来，他不让它作主。\",\n      \"key\": \"继续争取\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S11-6\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-8\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8e252e55-b10f-4ac2-9c68-3f42a50939de", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T215359905516Z", "elapsed_seconds": 242.438, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T21:58:02.364061+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "eace2fc532a393369763b07cbaf7623f1146d16f94ba0894e95a1e1744384748